{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261121/photo/bkn-20261121102532281-1121_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261121113110\"/><p>的士與私家車迎頭相撞。</p><p>石澳道發生交通意外。今日(21日)早上9時46分，一輛的士與一輛私家車駛至爛泥灣對開一彎位時，兩車迎頭相撞。意外中私家車上兩人受傷，清醒由救護車送院治理。受事件影響來回方向交通受阻一度全線封閉。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T03:43:51.153475+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T02:25:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T08:37:16.208288+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T03:37:23.868476+00:00","content_hash":"afcb227c91437817235b8d147df0ad1443931e6225f46c9602d1014df374a158","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}